00003CC4                           293  ; TRAP SERVICE ROUTINE.
00003CC4                           294  ; UPDATES THE SYSTEM VARIABLES KBDEDGE AND KBDVAL ACCORDING TO THE BITFIELD
00003CC4                           295  ; DESCRIBED IN SYSCONST. KBDVAL HOLDS THE CURRENT VALUES AND KBDEFGE HOLDS
00003CC4                           296  ; RISING EDGES FROM PREVIOUS CALL TO THE CURRENT ONE.
