00003E02                           463  FILLOAD
00003E02                           464  ; LOADS AN FILE FROM DISK TO MEMORY
00003E02                           465  ; INPUT    : A0 - DESTINATION ADDR. WITH ENOUGH SPACE AVAILABLE.
00003E02                           466  ;            A1 - POINTER TO FILE NAME
00003E02                           467  ; OUTPUT   : NONE
00003E02                           468  ; MODIFIES : NONE
00003E02                           469  ; NOTE     : THE READ DATA LOOP READS 1 BYTE AT A TIME TO ENSURE ALL FILES CAN
00003E02                           470  ;            BE LOADED. HOWEVER, IF THE FILE SIZE IS KNOWN BEFOREHAND, NO LOOP
00003E02                           471  ;            WOULD BE NECESSARY AND A SINGLE CALL TO TRAP #15 TASK 53 WOULD READ
00003E02                           472  ;            THE WHOLE FILE AS LONG AS THE FILE SIZE IS PLACED INTO D2.L.
00003E02                           473  ; NOTE     : THE ZERO-TERMINATOR (JUST BEFORE CLOSE THE FILE) IS A REQUIREMENT
00003E02                           474  ;            FOR TEXT-FILES IF THE TEXT IS TO BE PRINTED. FOR OTHER USES, IT
00003E02                           475  ;            CAN BE REMOVED.
00003E02                           476  ; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
00003E02  48E7 E040                477              MOVEM.L D0-D2/A1,-(A7)          ; SAVE REGISTERS
00003E06                           478              ; CLOSE ALL FILES
